{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0604_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7f29de4e53e4fc5b1fb1fb7343ce62996360a9eedb492ee351a725ee7a54fdee", "ja": "（翼のソロ曲をイメージした衣装が完成した。\n明るく可愛く、翼らしさが詰まっているな！）", "zh": "（以翼的个人曲为主题设计的服装完成了。\n明亮又可爱，充满了翼的风格！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0604_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7bb3bfc88bd15bc2c12657a92de6f0db6dfa0a69bdebe7225938779b1945756e", "ja": "わあ～。すっごくカワイイ～♪\nわたしにピッタリの衣装、ありがとうございまーす！", "zh": "哇～。超级可爱～♪\n为我量身打造的服装，太谢谢您啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0604_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "64b140f5b0f223532733f38a68d41afdbde4fe3eafa3798aa85226ac0f4e60ff", "ja": "{$P$}さん。この衣装を\n考えてる時って、やっぱりわたしのこと、ずっと……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。您在构思这套服装的时候，果然一直都在想着我……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0604_1003_p", "source_sha256": "529773572d176f472f1e9d07987fe6d89695db2e0bcd8d6f2e843d46be6d508e", "ja": "そりゃあ、翼が着る衣装だからな。\nステージで歌う時のことを考えて……。", "zh": "那当然是因为这是翼要穿的服装啊。还得考虑她在舞台上唱歌时的情况……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0604_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7dd65b620ed0e80b2ee0543637d39bddf98249ba6d1e1d62570611ddf28250a3", "ja": "む～、イジワル～！　そういう時は、\n「翼のことだけ考えてた」って言ってくださいよ～！", "zh": "呜～，真坏～！这种时候，就该说“我只想着翼”嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0604_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5aae2b10920f0d6021a36bde4ee3fa1df85ce6b20084e95abbeb72b3d97a859c", "ja": "そうしたらわたしも、たまには、\nアイドルらしいお返しとかするのに。たとえば……。", "zh": "那样的话，我偶尔也会做些像偶像一样的回礼哦。比如……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0604_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b74e31c36b86598567fa6d192a37f4fa5b8e54b46eab93549ebddf7e0ce1a56d", "ja": "少しだけ気合いを入れてお仕事してみたり、\nレッスンも、ちょっとだけ頑張っちゃおうかなーって。", "zh": "稍微打起精神来好好工作一下啦，\n还有练习也稍微努力一点什么的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0604_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2e2a19a7133207bc9b22df89ca4e528f04d23a2df8f2f93852aab3f2bc062e52", "ja": "翼……。\n俺としては、どっちも常に頑張ってほしいんだが。", "zh": "翼……。我的想法是，希望你两边都一直努力才好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0604_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b06f5ce521fc2f7934b83b8640fda073f0976a7378b20929776a6689480ad156", "ja": "じゃあ、今からでもハッキリ言ってくれたら\nわたし、やる気になるかもしれませんよ？", "zh": "那如果您现在就明确告诉我，\n我说不定会更有干劲哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0604_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "39b6c5bdb0ba3b98e0dad228d512118eff36482c1d61e6c8ce6f55a0b1d12679", "ja": "わたしに、こんなことしてほしいー！とか、\nわたしのこんなところが、すごくカワイイとか！", "zh": "像是“希望我这么做——！”之类的，\n或者是“我就喜欢你这一点，超级可爱！”之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0604_1010_p", "source_sha256": "d140a43cc0308f5045278115392ef755771f4c1507d92ee2a590c4376841e9c9", "ja": "してほしいこと？　……そうだなぁ。\n翼には、いつもキラキラしててほしいかな。", "zh": "想让我做的事？……这个嘛。\n希望翼一直都能闪闪发光吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0604_1011_p", "source_sha256": "f5a7609fb9eee2b04ff06260bcc8512653570d17db419152a4f2076858ac4f6e", "ja": "楽しくて明るい翼のステージは\n可愛いし、見てるこっちも元気をもらえるから。", "zh": "因为翼那充满欢乐、明朗的舞台既可爱，又能让台下的我也打起精神。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0604_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e80ca2c7ecf0f3b8429343ed6fcfbb0a7b67aad7634fc9be1b61462aeb8ac390", "ja": "及第点ってとこですねー。\nほんとは、わたしのこと、もっとほめてほしいけど。", "zh": "算是达到及格线吧——\n其实，我还想让你多夸夸我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0604_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4852a3347ce181113848ed745f90f487adb11d1ae0d47027be609ac9b3fc539a", "ja": "いつもステキな衣装をくれるんだから、\n言葉も一緒にくださいよ～。その方がハッピーだし！", "zh": "你总会给我准备很棒的服装，\n所以也顺便夸夸我嘛～。那样大家都会更开心嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0604_1014_p", "source_sha256": "0f359921dbf1aaf31db7a61dc9b026408efa305c18214dc7b6f84acf8692b094", "ja": "それはそうなんだが……。\n翼が期待してるような言葉は、その色々と……。", "zh": "话是这么说没错……不过，翼所期待的那种话，实在是有点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0604_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d3c33738fbd546774532039aba8cb1f447115650143cf615e722a6c243dacbf4", "ja": "……フンだ！　{$P$}さんにとって\nわたしの存在なんて、そんなもんなんですね。", "zh": "……哼！对{$P$}先生来说，\n我的存在就只是那么回事啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0604_1016_p", "source_sha256": "1eed55559958733a53e18b03dd161086d65928ff67cee80ac2febe03d30726e1", "ja": "えっ？　何を言って……。", "zh": "诶？你在说什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0604_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "48139a52d025030167136da954e28024a431e173539ea435ca839f156ad81a6d", "ja": "それなら……\nわたしがもっともーっとカワイくなってやるー！", "zh": "那样的话……\n我就变得更加更加可爱给你看——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0604_1018_p", "source_sha256": "dfc1e8938e2e5c860f3dcdef9255b90ac1683f23c91a918d2cea9a0ef255d2b9", "ja": "……ん？　えっ？", "zh": "……嗯？哎？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0604_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e12d955e399393aa03bb2944bd6f54111153d8c7ce3c9afe638ec04dcf83b65a", "ja": "{$P$}さん。次のライブは、\n今までで一番ドキドキさせちゃいますから！", "zh": "{$P$}先生。下一次演出，\n我一定会让你比以往任何时候都更加心跳加速的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0604_1020_016tsu", "source_sha256": "95b8b8a1ee319295c3ce5fab5ce7b93f6a49b9f0dfb7820ea11bca650b653f82", "ja": "だからその時は……{$P$}さんも、\nわたしをドキドキさせる言葉をくれなきゃダメですよ？", "zh": "所以到那时候……{$P$}先生也要对我说些让我心跳加速的话才行哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0604_1021_p", "source_sha256": "a59f6946522674dd23a951fe35394ab5f7562e51479ff8e33d3f82c07cb22cec", "ja": "ああ、わかった。次のライブ、楽しみにしてるよ。", "zh": "啊，知道了。我很期待下一场演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0604_1022_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2f044dc1e399ae377bd03a4f4f27570be726599e8a6780a64c8098b235e3445c", "ja": "やった～♪　絶対ですよ？\nよーし……わたし、張り切っちゃいま～す♪", "zh": "太好了～♪说定了哦？\n好——……我可要好好加把劲啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0604_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0604_1023_p", "source_sha256": "18d9556f3bd47980389e04569f91fd68a365843ffc142b6b6aabc172958435ec", "ja": "（勢いに乗った翼が魅せる次のライブは、すごいことに\nなるだろう。さて、褒め言葉の準備をしておくか……）", "zh": "（乘着这股势头的翼，下一场演出一定会很不得了。好了，先准备好夸她的话吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
